#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:46
#: 473d4a928bff437ab387cc560a2ec262 4c17d6add4c34f46a702c00e18e65f59
#: 50fad2fb29a64b47bc0b59d1cf40105b 87dd59138bf74ad892b956aa38381baa
#: e15f4c08fa1043ca98d143b95de3bb28
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NAssistant Software provided by the "
"manufacturer. More details can be found `here "
"<https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__. For CAN mode, in the setup screen "
"set \"Interface\" to CAN, Mode to \"active\", and bitrate to \"1000000\". "
"You can also set the \"ID\" to a unique number if planning to use multiple "
"TOFSenseP on a single CAN bus. Setting ID to 0 will accept all ID's."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NAssistant 软件配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 <https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__"
" 获取。对于 CAN 模式，在设置界面将「Interface」设为 CAN，模式设为「active」，波特率设为「1000000」。若计划在同一 CAN"
" 总线上使用多个 TOFSenseP，可将「ID」设置为唯一编号。将 ID 设为 0 将接受所有 ID 的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:52
#: 0ce70dc7871c4adfb323a8e0c701e85c 12d735c247b14456aa7818c9b23cc663
#: 1635d52fdcc94a48943e35d202dd64de 31f1b5fe9bc14e498ee5247ff6929e49
#: 348f465f79d74907b6ee4a4dfe70a43f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support  multiple instances of these "
"rangefinders connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use "
"multiple instances of these CAN rangefinders together, connect them to the "
"same bus."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持将多个此类测距仪连接至不同 CAN 接口。若需同时使用多个此类 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接至同一总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:55
#: 624ce82103c340e88385bb08ca0788db 7988b6d6131840a7a5c762482f33c643
#: 87a69acb2fca4ea090f3fb713fb48476 a42ed77aff4a4b2995419d50d309f424
#: c1451281a04d4366916b25c8cf89f5a9
msgid ""
"The 4 Pin JST-GH connector wiring of the sensor does not match with the CAN "
"wiring of most autopilots. Wiring incorrectly can lead to damaged sensor "
"and/or autopilot."
msgstr "传感器的 4 针 JST-GH 连接器接线与大多数飞控的 CAN 接线不匹配。接线错误可能导致传感器和/或飞控损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:57
